<Data>Data Flow Analysis : Design4Analysis&#x000D;&#x000A;2/6/2020..3:08 PM&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x2022; Warning: EnvFcChange &apos;Design4__Rx__RADAR_DDC_1.E2&apos;: The simulation sample rate (180.0000 MHz) is too small. Loss of information may occur. This may be acceptable. If not, increase the simulation sample rate to more than 280.0000 MHz.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x2022; Warning: EnvFcChange &apos;Design4__Tx__RADAR_DUC_1.E1&apos;: The simulation sample rate (180.0000 MHz) is too small. Loss of information may occur. This may be acceptable. If not, increase the simulation sample rate to more than 280.0000 MHz.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x2022; Warning: Mixer &apos;Design4__Tx.M3&apos;: Input signal level with gain applied exceeds LO signal level. Output signal may be unreliable.  Check design for Mixer input levels.&#x000D;&#x000A;Execution time: 17.858 sec&#x000D;&#x000A;</Data></Item>
